 style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Please do not include the following as Residential Financial Costs:&nbsp;</span></span></p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Personal loan interest&nbsp;</span></span></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Savings account interest received&nbsp;</span></span></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Personal credit card interest&nbsp;</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Property repairs and maintenance expenses&nbsp;</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mortgage capital repayments&nbsp;</span></span></li></ul><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Step 1:</strong> Download the UK Property Bridging Spreadsheet&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Before recording any Residential Financial Costs, download the UK Property Bridging S