le=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Step 4:&nbsp;</strong>Review the Imported summary&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Once the spreadsheet has been uploaded successfully&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Navigate to the Income &amp; Expenses summary and review each category carefully to ensure all transactions have been categorized appropriately&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Navigation: MTD &gt; Client specific source -UK property &gt; View &amp; Submit &gt; Submissions &gt; Summary of Each category &nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img width=\"624\" height=\"274\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9252460854/original/WbRcjYpgQTi1gBVmx0av6bCIoPy4DLFjbQ.png?1786016710\" class=\"WACImage SCXW217776536 BCX8 fr-fic fr-dii\" style